grok
------------------------------------------
Grok is a high performance open source JPEG 2000 codec.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libfmt12-12.2.1-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgrokj2k-devel-21.0.0-1bl1
  libgrokj2k2-21.0.0-1bl1
  libhwy1-1.4.0-1bl2
  libjpeg8-3.2.0-1
  liblcms2_2-2.19-1
  libpng16-1.6.59-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libtiff7-4.7.2-1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libfmt-devel-12.2.1-1bl1
  libhwy-devel-1.4.0-1bl2
  libjpeg-devel-3.2.0-1
  liblcms2-devel-2.19-1
  libpng-devel-1.6.59-1
  libtiff-devel-4.7.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  perl-5.44.0-1
  perl-Image-ExifTool-13.550.0-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/GrokImageCompression/grok

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/GrokImageCompression/grok.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack grok-21.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./grok-21.0.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/grok-21.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/grok-21.0.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgrokj2k2-21.0.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgrokj2k-devel-21.0.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(grok)
  /usr/bin/grk_compress.exe
  /usr/bin/grk_decompress.exe
  /usr/bin/grk_dump.exe
  /usr/bin/grk_transcode.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/grok.README
  /usr/share/doc/grok/CLI11/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/grok/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/grok/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/grok/spdlog/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/grok/taskflow/LICENSE

(libgrokj2k2)
  /usr/bin/cyggrokj2k-2.dll
  /usr/bin/cyggrokj2kcodec-2.dll

(libgrokj2k-devel)
  /usr/include/grok-21.0/Messenger.h
  /usr/include/grok-21.0/grk_config.h
  /usr/include/grok-21.0/grok.h
  /usr/include/grok-21.0/grok_codec.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/grok-21.0/GrokConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/grok-21.0/GrokConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/grok-21.0/GrokTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/grok-21.0/GrokTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/grok-21.0/GrokToolsTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/grok-21.0/GrokToolsTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libgrokj2k.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libgrokj2kcodec.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libgrokj2k.pc
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libgrokj2kcodec.pc

